@startuml
actor 사용자
participant "harness-workflow-complete.mjs" as cli
participant "completeWorkflow" as complete
participant "loadNamedWorkflow" as load
participant "runLifecycleHook" as lifecycle
participant "checkTrackerSync" as trackerGate
participant "inspectTrackerSync" as trackerInspect
participant "checkContractDocs" as contractGate
participant "inspectContracts" as inspect
participant "JsonlEventWriter" as journal
participant "finishWorkflowWorktree" as finish
participant "Private recovery archive" as archive
participant "Owned Git worktree" as worktree
사용자 -> cli : --root, --workflow, --base-ref, --state
cli -> complete : workflow_id, workspace_root, base_ref, state
complete -> complete : workspace preflight
complete -> load : workflow manifest 로드
complete -> complete : before_complete에 contract_docs 강제 포함
complete -> lifecycle : before_complete 실행
lifecycle -> contractGate : contract_docs 검사
contractGate -> inspect : workspace_root, contract_base_ref
inspect --> contractGate : pass 또는 fail + violations
contractGate --> lifecycle : gate verdict
lifecycle --> complete : pass 또는 fail verdict
complete -> journal : workflow_completion 결과 append
... 모든 성공·실패 경로의 finally ...
complete -> journal : close()
complete -> finish : finishWorkflowWorktree(outcome)
alt manager-owned parallel cleanup
  finish -> archive : 파일·index·HEAD 보존 및 검증
  finish -> worktree : 소유 worktree 제거 및 등록 확인
else unowned sequential cleanup
  note over complete,finish
    외부 부모가 완료 뒤 finish를 호출한다.
    소유 receipt가 없으면 workspace를 보존한다.
  end note
end
finish --> complete : removed / failed / not-owned
alt verdict가 pass
  complete --> cli : state=completed 또는 cleanup 실패 시 in-progress
  cli --> 사용자 : 결과 출력, exit code 0
else verdict가 fail 또는 blocked
  complete --> cli : state=in-progress, verdict, receipt 경로
  cli --> 사용자 : 결과 출력, exit code 1
end
note right of journal
  pass/fail 결과 모두 journal에 기록
end note
note right of archive
  SIGKILL 중에는 finally가 실행되지 않을 수 있다.
  다음 진입에서 pending receipt를 확인하고 종료된 실행만 finish로 복구한다.
end note
@enduml
